    "Executing a selected declared body through call_function_sync lost argument tape bindings, then the enclosing primitive branch applied derivative rules from a bare method name."
  ],
  "repair": [
    "FunctionInfo and FunctionDescriptor carry FunctionDecl.body.is_some(), including an actual empty block. Synthetic registrations and old descriptors default false. No return-storage, transfer, cleanup, or cryptographic proof is inferred.",
