    "Exact numeric declaration dispatch enters an ordinary call frame with receiver/argument tape propagation, generic witnesses and normal return handling. Actual primitive outcomes alone use builtin tape rules. By-value CBGR calls carry the decoded referent-slot tape identity.",
    "The precompile schema is v53-declared-function-bodies. The existing bake fingerprint already includes all changed producer and codec paths; no fresh bake was run by this gate."
  ],
